E_i^2=-1,     S.E_i=F.E_i=E_i.E_j=0  (i!=j),         (4.1)
```

where `F=B` and `i=1,...,9`.  The canonical class is

```text
K_Xtilde=-2S-(e+2)F+sum_(i=1)^9 E_i.                (4.2)
```

